{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/c54ccee02a5586f22f54af538f3f9a4f.avif?t=1769119982\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras_big/c54ccee02a5586f22f54af538f3f9a4f.webp?t=1769119982 width=1560 height=763 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;Welcome to the best shop in the whole Lands of Sinners! How much gold coins do you have? Give me ALL OF THEM!!!&quot;</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/dd79571640d51832795fb7bab52b9009.apng?t=1769119982\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/dd79571640d51832795fb7bab52b9009.poster.avif?t=1769119982\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=176 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>-Kevin</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catfighter is a 2D pixel game where the player shapes the fate of the main character, Mickesh. Players can expect a dark fantasy story, challenging boss fights, and the horrors that await him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/1bf94e048e0fdc79c00a001e246b4e3e.avif?t=1769119982\" width=192 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But will Mickesh face the darkness, or become the horror <i><strong>himself</strong></i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/de28e7a1857e12b8e7a50dd06b4c5ebc.poster.avif?t=1769119982\" width=448 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/de28e7a1857e12b8e7a50dd06b4c5ebc.webm?t=1769119982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features multiple biomes for the player to explore.</strong> Each boss\u2019s story is revealed when entering their biome or a specific location. Players can save their progress at the <i>bonbox</i>, in which Mickesh can also hide. For some grotesque, cartoonish reason, the bonbox teleports him directly in front of Kevin\u2019s shop, where he can empty his pockets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By touching the red portal next to the shop, players can return to their last bonbox. In the <strong>Lands of Sinners</strong>, nothing is truly normal and all oddities are part of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must take care of Mickesh, ensuring he doesn\u2019t get harmed. After all, you wouldn\u2019t want to hurt a cute cat\u2026 right?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mickesh needs to stay healthy and @L1v3, so it\u2019s recommended to drink milk by pressing <strong>E</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He can roll in any direction by pressing <strong>SPACE</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mickesh can draw a sword from his pockets and use it for <u><i><strong>self-defense</strong></i></u>, either with the arrow keys or the Q<strong>\u00a0</strong>button (for parrying). He may not be the brightest, but one thing\u2019s certain: he would never use his tail as a weapon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good luck exploring the Lands of Sinners!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Kevin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664280/47acbaaca40bf178446623f77441944b3e7abd55.jpg"},{"name":"K3v1n","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664280/6a8ddb42265ff78a28f292d80a42957095bfdae7.jpg"},{"name":"Yuki","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664280/ea8e22c1c7a50d3414020c40cc708f8a2a2ace14.jpg"},{"name":"Yvk1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664280/10236ad461d6e173a8d57b50bd98d655313a8af2.jpg"},{"name":"Bingus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664280/033f85e463c7d713a3ba75f5679a8ac3bd66bd3c.jpg"},{"name":"B1ngvs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664280/f9ed4deb85ac872c8166e82df71d80a174495188.jpg"},{"name":"Miscar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664280/c36c7a9889aa8049c2bfc0f7bde0a19d31a807d5.jpg"},{"name":"M1sc@r","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664280/c97305644db7f7e31b360d0bbf54107e982dfc51.jpg"},{"name":"Brucha","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664280/cc2c802ebf08444c6dae5349b37028724c721f99.jpg"},{"name":"Brvch@","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664280/474dea6794f16d5c022151e518699a8ece4a4b03.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664280?t=1769119982","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/3fd8423aed01bc044cf2c30fc12b173530f2cc88/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769119982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/15b1dbcad472b64866169569629e141514f64a89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769119982","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/15b1dbcad472b64866169569629e141514f64a89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769119982","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"All violence in my game is fictional, just like the entire fantasy world. 95% of the violence in the entire game is hidden in the genocide route, and the game also becomes a psychological horror story."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/c54ccee02a5586f22f54af538f3f9a4f.avif?t=1769119982\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras_big/c54ccee02a5586f22f54af538f3f9a4f.webp?t=1769119982 width=1560 height=763 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;Welcome to the best shop in the whole Lands of Sinners! How much gold coins do you have? Give me ALL OF THEM!!!&quot;</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/dd79571640d51832795fb7bab52b9009.apng?t=1769119982\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/dd79571640d51832795fb7bab52b9009.poster.avif?t=1769119982\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=176 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>-Kevin</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catfighter is a 2D pixel game where the player shapes the fate of the main character, Mickesh. Players can expect a dark fantasy story, challenging boss fights, and the horrors that await him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/1bf94e048e0fdc79c00a001e246b4e3e.avif?t=1769119982\" width=192 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But will Mickesh face the darkness, or become the horror <i><strong>himself</strong></i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/de28e7a1857e12b8e7a50dd06b4c5ebc.poster.avif?t=1769119982\" width=448 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/de28e7a1857e12b8e7a50dd06b4c5ebc.webm?t=1769119982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features multiple biomes for the player to explore.</strong> Each boss\u2019s story is revealed when entering their biome or a specific location. Players can save their progress at the <i>bonbox</i>, in which Mickesh can also hide. For some grotesque, cartoonish reason, the bonbox teleports him directly in front of Kevin\u2019s shop, where he can empty his pockets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By touching the red portal next to the shop, players can return to their last bonbox. In the <strong>Lands of Sinners</strong>, nothing is truly normal and all oddities are part of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must take care of Mickesh, ensuring he doesn\u2019t get harmed. After all, you wouldn\u2019t want to hurt a cute cat\u2026 right?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mickesh needs to stay healthy and @L1v3, so it\u2019s recommended to drink milk by pressing <strong>E</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He can roll in any direction by pressing <strong>SPACE</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mickesh can draw a sword from his pockets and use it for <u><i><strong>self-defense</strong></i></u>, either with the arrow keys or the Q<strong>\u00a0</strong>button (for parrying). He may not be the brightest, but one thing\u2019s certain: he would never use his tail as a weapon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good luck exploring the Lands of Sinners!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["OreonCZ"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/c131b01e07ba66a897be76533ed03f6728de6bf3/header.jpg?t=1769119982","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2,00 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 520</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple silicon</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3664280/1714494240/0e0bc81f58f9e610553c7e199402794baef281f6/1758394957/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760649615","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3664280/1714494240/0e0bc81f58f9e610553c7e199402794baef281f6/1758394957/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760649615","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3664280/1714494240/0e0bc81f58f9e610553c7e199402794baef281f6/1758394957/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760649615","id":257202963,"name":"Catfighter Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257202963/231096e5d167f273c95eae1d166d6bdc57db5197/movie_600x337.jpg?t=176